er/materials/serverless/README.md#pricing-1"></a>Pricing:</h3>
<p dir=3D"auto" data-sourcepos=3D"190:1-190:359">Lambda pricing has 2 dimen=
sions: number of requests and total execution time in milliseconds. You are=
