n, the time it takes for your code to execute. You're not charged when Lamb=
da awaits for trigger request. Duration price depends on the amount of memo=
ry you allocate to your function.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto" data-sourcepos=3D"192:1-192:116">The AWS Lambda free usage =
tier includes 1M free requests per month and 400,000 GB-seconds of compute =
time per month.</p>
